<title>PORTUGAL: Avge yld 5.482 pct on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Avge yld 5.482 pct on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Institute for Public Credit Management's auction of 15 billion escudos of five-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY:23/3/02</p>
<p>    AMOUNT PLACED: 15 billion escudos     COUPON: 5.75 pct</p>
<p>    AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 5.471813 pct</p>
<p>    HIGHEST ACCEPTED: 5.48  LOWEST: 5.45</p>
<p>    BIDS: 50.70 billion escudos PAYMENT FREQUENCY:Annual</p>
<p>    PAYMENT DATE: 21/7/97</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 205.9 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
